# Where the retrieval API lives. Leave unset in development: `npm run dev`
# proxies /api -> http://127.0.0.1:8000 (see vite.config.ts), which keeps the
# calls same-origin and sidesteps the API having no CORS middleware.
#
# Set this only when the built frontend is served from an origin that is *not*
# in front of the API. The API must then allow this origin via CORS.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Override the dev proxy target (e.g. the API running in the compose stack).
# VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000
